{"version":1,"content":"<p>網絡安全研究人員近期披露，一款名為Remus的惡意軟件正引發廣泛關注。與傳統竊密程序不同的是，該惡意軟件被發現能夠竊取與Google賬户相關的身份驗證令牌，從而讓攻擊者在某些情況下即使在受害者修改密碼後，仍可能繼續保留對Gmail賬户的訪問權限。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586032.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.615259+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T05:58:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:14.147077+00:00","content_hash":"b237a7cef25b3e4bb6f97b39bb19d4616fe893a2e6d1b2a9d92cdbd9ba744145","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}